# Locale sync (required)

Whenever you add or change any `Lang["..."]` entry in `Locales/enUS.lua`:

1. Add the same key to **every** other locale file: `frFR`, `deDE`, `esES`, `ruRU`, `zhCN`, `zhTW`, `koKR`.
2. Prefer a real translation when you already have one (Wowhead / existing style). Otherwise use the English `enUS` value as a temporary fallback.
3. After locale edits, run `powershell -File sync_locales.ps1` from the addon root to backfill any missing keys, then confirm verify output shows `missing=0` for all locales.
4. Do not leave Forever/Vanilla dungeon quest, item (`I_`), NPC (`N1_`/`N2_`), or location keys only in `enUS`.

AceLocale falls back to English, but this project requires explicit keys in all language files.
